          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation in the sky of a \"vertical smoke column\" from which emerges a dark point, which in turn generates a finer smoke trail: observation of the condensation trail of a commercial aircraft.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "a2e7606a5d86d053b4dce61aee91ac2dd916098497d5e553905bcbf9da1c9353"
